  text: Press and Hold until the Timer complets and trigger an Animation & Action.
    Using a ActionState we can manipulate the AnimatorController to keep looping
    a animation until the Timer is finished.
  _textUI: {fileID: 538157784340050862}
  painel: {fileID: 498227588590259334}
